<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Sept unemployment 835,314 vs 836,104.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Sept unemployment 835,314 vs 836,104.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV UNEMPLOYMENT   Sept 96	 Aug 96	    Sept 95</p>
<p> number seeking work     835,314	836,104	    783,994</p>
<p> vacancies		    30,876	 23,352	     24,693</p>
<p> total employed	  2.065 mln    2.074 mln	  2.100 mln</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data do not include private sector.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
